@title Bike Share Demand: Two Weeks in October
@subtitle Portside Bike Share, 2026-10-05 to 2026-10-18

# Two weeks at a glance
kpi Rides | 54,410 | 14 days
kpi Daily average | 3,886 | rides a day
kpi Week 2 vs week 1 | +8.9% | neutral
kpi Network | 86 stations | 1,100 bikes

Week 1 had 26,040 rides and week 2 had 28,370, up 8.9 percent. The busiest day was Saturday 2026-10-17 with 5,340 rides. The quietest was Thursday 2026-10-08, with 2,280 rides on a rainy day with 31 mm of rain.

# Daily rides
data rides = day,rides; Mon 05,3120; Tue 06,3340; Wed 07,3510; Thu 08,2280; Fri 09,3690; Sat 10,5120; Sun 11,4980; Mon 12,3250; Tue 13,3460; Wed 14,3580; Thu 15,3720; Fri 16,3810; Sat 17,5340; Sun 18,5210
chart line rides x=day y=rides title="Daily rides, October 2026"
table rides bar=rides

Saturdays and Sundays were the peaks of both weeks. Thursday 2026-10-08 was the only weekday below 3,000 rides.

# Weekdays and weekends
table = Day type,Days,Average rides a day; Weekdays,10,3376; Weekend days,4,5162.5

Weekend days averaged 5,162.5 rides, against 3,376 on weekdays, about 53 percent more. Plan weekend rebalancing crews around that gap.
